[Authorized source](https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/rotator-cuff-tears/).

Introduces cuff anatomy, tear descriptions, symptoms, and clinical options. Note the explicit recognition that some tears are painless. Use the professional guidelines for more detailed evidence questions.

